---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const unlocks = (await getCollection('unlocks')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<section id="unlocks" class="band band--navy" aria-labelledby="unlocks-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The revenue engine</p>
      <h2 id="unlocks-title">Momentum Unlocks.</h2>
      <p class="lede muted">
        Each unlock is a single, well-timed commercial moment, earned by what the athlete has just done. Behavioural,
        not calendar-based. Never batch-sent.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="list">
      {unlocks.map(({ data }) => (
        <article class:list={['unlock', { featured: data.featured }]}>
          {data.featured && <p class="label star">★ Top unlock</p>}
          <h3>{data.name}</h3>
          <p class="label window">{data.window}</p>
          <p class="muted">{data.moment}</p>
          {data.rate && (
            <p class="rate">
              <span class="v">{data.rate.value}</span>
              <span class="t">{data.rate.text} <span class="tag">{data.rate.label}</span></span>
            </p>
          )}
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="notes">
      <p class="care"><strong>Plateau is a care signal, never a purchase trigger.</strong> When an athlete stalls, every unlock is held back. Protecting your relationship with the athlete comes first.</p>
      <p class="muted">The full library is mapped to your catalogue during onboarding.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .list { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .list { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  .unlock { border: 1px solid var(--rule-dark); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.75rem; display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; align-content: start; }
  .featured { background: var(--navy-3); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .star { color: var(--gold); margin: 0; }
  h3 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .window { color: var(--electric); margin: 0; }
  .unlock p { margin: 0; }
  .rate { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; margin-top: 0.75rem !important; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-dark); }
  .v { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 4.5rem; line-height: 0.9; color: var(--electric); }
  .t { color: var(--on-navy-muted); }
  .tag { color: var(--gold); margin-left: 0.4rem; }
  .notes { margin-top: 2.5rem; display: grid; gap: 1rem; max-width: 64ch; }
  .care { border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding-left: 1rem; }
</style>
